<ServicePage title="Residential Flat Roofing Leeds | WW Roofing" description="RubberBond EPDM flat roof replacement for Leeds homes, extensions, dormers and garages. Discuss your project with WW Roofing." kicker="For homeowners" heading="A dependable roof over your home." intro="Flat roof replacement and refurbishment for extensions, dormers and garages, with a specification that starts with your property."><section class="section"><div class="wrap editorial"><div class="content-grid"><div><h2>Start with the roof you have</h2><p>We look at the existing covering, the deck underneath, drainage and the way the roof meets walls, gutters and rooflights. We explain whether refurbishment, replacement or a more limited repair is appropriate.</p><h2>Extensions, dormers and garages</h2><p>An extension protects an everyday living space. A dormer has close junctions with a pitched roof. A garage may have a different deck and insulation requirement. We tailor the proposed work to those differences.</p><h2>Understand what is included</h2><p>We discuss access, preparation, deck repairs, insulation and vapour control, the membrane and the finish at the edges. The quote should make the scope clear, including anything that can only be assessed once the roof is opened up.</p><p>The same care that goes into a larger roof applies to your home. Our Mount St Mary installation is an example of the attention required at drains, edges and junctions.</p><h2>Tell us about your project</h2><p>Share your postcode, the kind of roof, any leaks or visible concerns and approximate dimensions if known. Photos taken from a safe position can help.</p><a href="/flat-roofing/">Read about RubberBond installation and warranty considerations</a>.</div><aside class="aside-panel"><h2>Arrange the next step</h2><p>Call 07565 301143 or send your project details. We will discuss what is needed to assess the roof and prepare a quote.</p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Request a quote ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/areas/">Areas we cover ↗</a></aside></div></div></section><FlatProject/></ServicePage>